WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Start with a recorded GPX
Match a photo to a track recorded at the same time. This walkthrough uses clearly labeled synthetic demo data.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Check the track before import
Review the map, recording times and coverage. Planned routes without timestamps cannot locate your photos.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:28.000
Preview the matching location
On this UTC+8 device, 10:01 means 02:01 UTC. The preview finds a location without changing the photo.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:36.000
The sample photo is selected
After manual selection, one item is ready for GPS tagging. Check that its capture time is covered before continuing.

00:00:36.000 --> 00:00:46.000
Add the missing GPS location
The result reports 1 success and no failures, skips or unmatched items. iPhone keeps the original and the GPS-tagged copy.

00:00:46.000 --> 00:00:56.000
Check the location in Apple Photos
Open Apple Photos to check the tagged copy’s map location. The original is kept; review the copy before any cleanup.
